    <string name="import_title">Import</string>
    <string name="import_sub">Your collection from the Sheet (.xlsx) or a .csv</string>
    <string name="import_explain">Bring your existing collection over in one go: set tabs, Loose cards, Decks and History from the MTG Collection Sheet. Nothing is counted twice: cards in decks stay in their deck.</string>
    <string name="import_how">How to get the file: open your Sheet in Google Sheets. On a computer: File → Download → Microsoft Excel (.xlsx). In the Google Sheets app: ⋮ → Share and export → Save as → Excel. Then choose that file here. A .csv of one tab also works.</string>
