    <string name="price_explain">Prices come from Scryfall: Cardmarket in euros or TCGplayer in dollars, normally the trend price, never the lowest price. Foils use the foil price. Scryfall gives one price per print: language and condition do not count, so a Japanese or played card shows the same price as an English near-mint one. Proxies count as zero. Prices are updated every day on Wi-Fi.</string>
